<p>This feature looks cool though. Ive seen a lot of people complain about material manager taking up a lot of space, so this is definitely a welcome change. Although I just naturally switched to using the dropdown in properties to change materials, seeing the new menu there would be cool.</p>
<p>EDIT: Nevermind the ribbon layout. I was on the Home tab instead of Model lol</p>
