            <div class='post' itemprop='text'>
              <p>I’ve seen the button (couldn’t try it for myself because I’m experiencing a bug with the beta), but it’s still not as condensed as the current one. As an example to compare with the existing one: <img src="//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/5X/c/e/d/f/cedfe5939105aa69e93622ec2baea9fab95f16ad.png" alt="image" data-base62-sha1="tw63ryVSNP0RpQbxl3V7LRCgpAh" width="180" height="238">.</p>
<p>And this doesn’t address the fact that there is probably no possibility to quick assign a material with your keyboard, which is probably a 0.1% niche thing but still a very convenient feature I think.</p>
<p>However, is this dropdown gonna be implemented for MaterialVariants? Since variants often differ per-game &amp; per-material, I would absolutely love this dropdown on the Variants part.</p>
